# MuxCore Cosign Public Key
#
# This file contains the cosign public key used to verify MuxCore binary
# signatures and SLSA provenance attestations. The corresponding private
# key is stored as a GitHub Actions secret (COSIGN_PRIVATE_KEY) and is
# used during the release process to sign release artifacts.
#
# Verification:
#
#   cosign verify-blob \
#     --key .well-known/cosign.pub \
#     --signature muxcored.sig \
#     muxcored
#
# To verify SLSA provenance attestations:
#
#   cosign verify-blob-attestation \
#     --key .well-known/cosign.pub \
#     --type slsaprovenance \
#     --signature provenance.sig \
#     muxcored
#
# Replace this file with the actual public key when deploying the release
# pipeline. The key can be exported from the COSIGN_PRIVATE_KEY secret:
#
#   cosign public-key --key env://COSIGN_PRIVATE_KEY > .well-known/cosign.pub
#
# See: https://docs.sigstore.dev/cosign/overview/
